      "task": "For a change to the JDBC callback wrappers, identify the Java JdbcOperations overload that each Kotlin extension calls. Start with three calls in JdbcOperationsExtensionsTests. Call A is template.query<Int>(sql, 3) with a one-parameter lambda. Call B is template.query(sql, 3) with a one-parameter lambda outside assertThat. Call C is template.query(sql, 3) with a two-parameter lambda in the test that expects [1, 2, 3]. Return only a JSON array of strings in the form <letter>=JdbcOperations.query(<parameter types>). Use simple Java type names without generic arguments or annotations. Use comma-space separators and Object... for varargs.",
